 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JwPoO2dv\">本接口支持获取优化目标关联橙子建站站点列表，方便您通过API创编营销</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HZz8sMiG\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">注意：</span>本接口<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">暂不支持</span>区分橙子落地页是账户下<u>自建的还是被共享的</u>，您可通过以下方式进行区分：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MTRllSEO\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7k5cihbH\">步骤1：通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1696710620579852?origin=left_nav\" target=\"_blank\">获取橙子建站站点列表</a>】查询账户下全量站点信息，该接口支持区分站点来源（账户创建站点 or 被共享站点）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SemAJ6d8\">步骤2：调用本接口，查询external_action、deep_external_action关联的橙子落地页，根据步骤1获取结果<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">在本地自行区分</span></li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201744730061970445%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-liHA0TS9\" id=\"h346b9f0-liHA0TS9\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-FbntsRgC\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/orange_site/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/orange_site/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1755162848410635\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Z92JcpJ5\" id=\"h346b9f0-Z92JcpJ5\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-d8hexnGs\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-GO73h2fM\" id=\"h346b9f0-GO73h2fM\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6BJ6UPuP\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-SgqC5lH3\" id=\"h346b9f0-SgqC5lH3\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 235px;\" width=\"235\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-brnK7Fwa\">投放账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lvjoCgjT\">页码，范围：page &gt;= 1</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i5SgKO7a\">页面数据量，范围：<code>1-50</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0DCLx7Wb\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qG866NlI\">站点状态，可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-pRPRzATw\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NVgXUXtm\"><code>SITE_ALL</code> 查询所有</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yvn1GEIS\"><code>SITE_OFFLINE</code> 已下线</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XHfk06Cn\"><code>SITE_ONLINE</code> 已上线（包含审核中、已上线可投放的站点）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4rPM2BM3\"><code>SITE_REJECTED</code> 审核不通过</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DRICGVs9\"><code>SITE_TRASH</code> 删除或禁止</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" s